  "clarifying_question": null,
  "summary": "No listed instrument can perform non-destructive 3D internal imaging of a porous specimen. The ideal technique for this is micro-computed tomography (micro-CT), which is not currently available in the provided list. The ESEM (EQ10) is available for high-resolution surface imaging, but it is not suitable for visualizing internal structures."
}

